{"4006300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Something Meaningful", "steam_appid": 4006300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a neighborhood packed with characters, activities, and situations you never saw coming. Work your way up from nothing by improving your attributes, learning new skills, and unlocking new areas as your reputation grows. Talk to everyone, stumble into minigames out of nowhere, and make choices that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/bfdb213650d95e12cbcba52aa3f45abc.webp?t=1786154380\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/bfdb213650d95e12cbcba52aa3f45abc.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" class=\"bb_img\" width=628 height=119 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/e93c066f56a1d90cee0d033c40c6abdd.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/e93c066f56a1d90cee0d033c40c6abdd.webm?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/e93c066f56a1d90cee0d033c40c6abdd.mp4?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with no privileges, you'll need to work hard to improve your attributes, acquire new skills, and earn items. With each achievement, you gain access to new areas, new possibilities and a city that becomes increasingly alive and full of opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/1592c8fcf90b1666e97e150dd4df0652.webp?t=1786154380\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/1592c8fcf90b1666e97e150dd4df0652.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=119 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/49879a18df55f1fe62de3ba5a45c59f1.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/49879a18df55f1fe62de3ba5a45c59f1.webm?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/49879a18df55f1fe62de3ba5a45c59f1.mp4?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what you'll find around the next corner: a funny dialogue, an unusual situation, or a completely unconventional minigame. But deep down, there's always the feeling that each decision might bring you closer to something truly meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/bb3058756f1c642411dbce2464f63c73.webp?t=1786154380\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/bb3058756f1c642411dbce2464f63c73.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" class=\"bb_img\" width=472 height=119 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/6f196058ef1537e95f593e8d6a0c1057.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/6f196058ef1537e95f593e8d6a0c1057.webm?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/6f196058ef1537e95f593e8d6a0c1057.mp4?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame is different from the last and appears when you least expect it. Every victory brings you closer to a new achievement: you can earn new items, unlock upgrades, win competitions, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/3d1454f1194b0b83d8aa59de53ee4729.webp?t=1786154380\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/3d1454f1194b0b83d8aa59de53ee4729.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" class=\"bb_img\" width=774 height=119 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/2921865b13904ea7cc4f509dc1d8992b.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/2921865b13904ea7cc4f509dc1d8992b.webm?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/2921865b13904ea7cc4f509dc1d8992b.mp4?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this program, no one needs to look the same. An AI developed by <strong>Xmeta Corp</strong> ensures you’ll have an avatar that reflects your true self. Interact with everyone and discover how your choices shape your journey. Every conversation can open new opportunities or reveal the city's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/a49b04f9fdeb8f852da207171975ba30.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/a49b04f9fdeb8f852da207171975ba30.webm?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a neighborhood packed with characters, activities, and situations you never saw coming. Work your way up from nothing by improving your attributes, learning new skills, and unlocking new areas as your reputation grows. Talk to everyone, stumble into minigames out of nowhere, and make choices that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/bfdb213650d95e12cbcba52aa3f45abc.webp?t=1786154380\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/bfdb213650d95e12cbcba52aa3f45abc.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" class=\"bb_img\" width=628 height=119 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/e93c066f56a1d90cee0d033c40c6abdd.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/e93c066f56a1d90cee0d033c40c6abdd.webm?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/e93c066f56a1d90cee0d033c40c6abdd.mp4?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with no privileges, you'll need to work hard to improve your attributes, acquire new skills, and earn items. With each achievement, you gain access to new areas, new possibilities and a city that becomes increasingly alive and full of opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/1592c8fcf90b1666e97e150dd4df0652.webp?t=1786154380\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/1592c8fcf90b1666e97e150dd4df0652.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=119 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/49879a18df55f1fe62de3ba5a45c59f1.poster.avif?t=1786154380\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/49879a18df55f1fe62de3ba5a45c59f1.webm?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006300/extras/49879a18df55f1fe62de3ba5a45c59f1.mp4?t=1786154380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what you'll find around the next corner: a funny dialogue, an unusual situation, or a completely unconventional minigame. But deep down, there's always the feeling that each decision might bring you closer to something truly meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"ht